# Arrapago Reef qm6's reply kinds (no script; default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY). Its lines are the COR chain's, each a
# Progress, and each section is open at a different point of the chain, so a GM puts two of them open together (out of
# play order: a Corsair with Luck of the Draw accepted): Luck of the Draw's 211 (a progress cutscene, Prog 2) against
# each of the others. The two tie: the first talk plays the container listed first, a later one rotates. An Event in
# place of either would lose every talk. Each finish is undone by a GM (or fails on a full bag), so the tie stays. All
# five Corsairs have Luck of the Draw accepted at Prog 2. bob (40): Equipped for All Occasions available: 211 and 228.
# carl (40): Equipped accepted at Prog 3: 211 and 231. dan (50): Equipped completed, Navigating the Unfriendly Seas
# available: 211 and 232. ed (50): Navigating accepted at Prog 3: 211 and 233 (a full bag: its completion fails). fred
# (66): Against All Odds completed, Breaking the Bonds of Fate available: 211 and 234 (finished on option 1: not begun).
lists ArrapagoReef/qm6/onTrigger
char zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=WAR lvl=20
char bob zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=40
char carl zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=40
char dan zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=50
char ed zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=50
char fred zone=ArrapagoReef pos=470.267,-12.292,111.817 job=COR lvl=66
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw accepted
carl: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions accepted
carl: charvar Quest[6][24]Prog 3
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw accepted
dan: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions completed
ed: quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw accepted
ed: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2
ed: quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions completed
ed: quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas accepted
ed: charvar Quest[6][25]Prog 3
fred: quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw accepted
fred: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2
fred: quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions completed
fred: quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas completed
fred: quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
login
bob: login
bob: trigger qm6                        # 211 and 228 tie: the first container's
bob: finish                             # 211: Prog 3; or 228: begun
bob: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2          # a GM
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions available   # a GM
bob: trigger qm6                        # rotated
bob: finish
bob: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2          # a GM
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.EquippedForAllOccasions available   # a GM
bob: trigger qm6                        # rotated again
bob: finish
bob: logout
carl: login
carl: trigger qm6                       # 211 and 231 tie: the first container's
carl: finish                            # 211: Prog 3; or 231: Prog 4
carl: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2         # a GM
carl: charvar Quest[6][24]Prog 3        # a GM
carl: trigger qm6                       # rotated
carl: finish
carl: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2         # a GM
carl: charvar Quest[6][24]Prog 3        # a GM
carl: trigger qm6                       # rotated again
carl: finish
carl: logout
dan: login
dan: trigger qm6                        # 211 and 232 tie: the first container's
dan: finish                             # 211: Prog 3; or 232: begun
dan: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2          # a GM
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas available   # a GM
dan: trigger qm6                        # rotated
dan: finish
dan: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2          # a GM
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.NavigatingTheUnfriendlySeas available   # a GM
dan: trigger qm6                        # rotated again
dan: finish
dan: logout
ed: login
ed: fill-inventory
ed: trigger qm6                         # 211 and 233 tie: the first container's
ed: finish                              # 211: Prog 3; or 233: the culottes do not fit (nothing)
ed: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2           # a GM
ed: trigger qm6                         # rotated
ed: finish
ed: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2           # a GM
ed: trigger qm6                         # rotated again
ed: finish
ed: logout
fred: login
fred: trigger qm6                       # 211 and 234 tie: the first container's
fred: finish option=1                   # 211: Prog 3; or 234 on option 1: nothing
fred: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2         # a GM
fred: trigger qm6                       # rotated
fred: finish option=1
fred: charvar Quest[6][6]Prog 2         # a GM
fred: trigger qm6                       # rotated again
fred: finish option=1
fred: logout
